{%- comment -%}
  blocks/ds-hero-title.liquid

  Display H1 for the hero. Two visual layers behind the text:
    1. Static white blurred duplicate (the halo)
    2. Animated orange spotlight pseudo-element that orbits behind the
       glyphs in a slow figure-eight (on-brand demo of BACKLIT itself).
       Toggleable via the block's `spotlight` setting.

  Newlines in the merchant's source become <br>.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign safe_text = block.settings.text | escape | newline_to_br
  assign spotlight = block.settings.spotlight
  assign size_pct  = block.settings.size_pct | default: 100
  assign cls = 'ds-hero-title'
  if spotlight
    assign cls = 'ds-hero-title ds-hero-title--spotlight'
  endif
-%}

<h1
  class="{{ cls }}"
  {%- if size_pct != 100 %} style="font-size: calc(var(--fs-display) * {{ size_pct }} / 100)"{% endif %}
  {{ block.shopify_attributes }}
>
  {{ safe_text }}
  {%- comment -%}
    Glow halo. The text used to be duplicated as a real child node here,
    which made the H1 read twice to crawlers ("… Your Work. … Your Work.").
    The span is now empty and renders its copy of the text through a
    ::before pseudo (content: attr(data-text)), so the headline exists
    exactly once in the DOM / textContent. data-text carries the raw
    text with literal newlines; white-space: pre-line (below) turns them
    into line breaks. The 48px blur means exact wrap parity is moot.
    aria-hidden keeps assistive tech on the single real text node.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  <span class="ds-hero-title__glow" data-text="{{ block.settings.text | escape }}" aria-hidden="true"></span>
</h1>

{%- comment -%}
  Scoped here (not in each hero section) so the pseudo-text mechanism
  travels with the block. The per-section rules still style the .glow
  span itself (blur, color, position) — this only supplies its text.
{%- endcomment -%}
<style>
  .ds-hero-title__glow::before {
    content: attr(data-text);
    white-space: pre-line;
  }
</style>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Hero title",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "text",
      "default": "Real light.\nOne click.",
      "label": "Headline",
      "info": "Each line break renders as a <br>. A blurred white duplicate sits behind to form a glow halo."
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "spotlight",
      "default": true,
      "label": "Animated backlight",
      "info": "Adds a warm spotlight that orbits behind the text — like a live BACKLIT demo. Respects prefers-reduced-motion."
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "size_pct",
      "label": "Size",
      "min": 50,
      "max": 180,
      "step": 5,
      "default": 100,
      "unit": "%",
      "info": "Multiplies the responsive default. 100% = unchanged; lower shrinks, higher enlarges. Mobile still scales down proportionally."
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
